'' A test that runs past --timeout is killed and reported TIMED OUT, and the next test runs.
'' TEST: cli
'' HOSTS: windows
'' ENV: TIKO_MODCACHE=build/.ttt/cache
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' CLEAN: build/.ttt
'' COPY: tests/driver/src/test-hang => build/.ttt/proj
'' ARGS: test -target windows-x86_64 build/.ttt/proj --timeout 2
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: test hangs ... TIMED OUT (2 s)
'' EXPECT-OUT: test after the hang ... ok
'' EXPECT-OUT: test result: FAILED. 1 passed; 0 failed; 0 crashed; 1 timed out; 0 skipped
